# The dapr4s Wasm-component layer these examples build against. It is not on Maven Central yet: it comes
# from a `publishLocal` of a PINNED commit of dapr4s PR #44 (https://github.com/sideeffffect/dapr4s/pull/44,
# branch feat/wasm-component), built in RELEASE mode, so the classpath is "Central dapr4s + small local
# wasm layer":
#   - dapr4s itself: com.github.sideeffffect::dapr4s_sjs1_3:$DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE from Maven Central (Scala.js IR,
#     linked into the component by the scala-wasm linker);
#   - local: dapr4s-wasm (the wall), dapr4s-wasm-core (DaprComponent), the 2.13 WIT bindings + hand-written glue and the
#     sbt-dapr4s-wasm plugin, version $DAPR4S_WASM_VERSION (sbt-dynver of $DAPR4S_COMMIT).
# Once PR #44 is merged and the wasm layer is released, this file goes away: the plugin and the layer become
# ordinary Maven Central dependencies at a release version, and CI stops building dapr4s from source.
# Read by wasm/project/plugins.sbt, wasm/scripts/publish-dapr4s-wasm.sh and CI (.github/workflows/e2e.yml).
DAPR4S_COMMIT=348edb5fd415bb886bca3588d24312e115ebc226
DAPR4S_WASM_VERSION=3.0.0+10-348edb5f-SNAPSHOT
DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE=3.0.0
